<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Sobre BURGCALC</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      background: #f7f4ee;
      color: #211a16;
    }

    header {
      background: #211a16;
      color: #fff8ef;
      padding: 18px clamp(16px, 4vw, 48px);
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 18px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 1.6rem;
    }

    nav {
      display: flex;
      gap: 14px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    nav a {
      color: #f2c078;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    main {
      width: min(960px, calc(100% - 32px));
      margin: 32px auto;
    }

    .painel {
      background: #fff;
      border: 1px solid #e4ddd2;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 24px;
      box-shadow: 0 14px 35px rgba(33, 26, 22, 0.08);
    }

    .integrantes {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 18px;
      margin-top: 22px;
    }

    .integrante {
      border: 1px solid #e4ddd2;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 18px;
      background: #fffdf9;
    }

    .foto {
      height: 160px;
      border: 1px dashed #b7a99a;
      border-radius: 8px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      color: #695f58;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 700px) {
      .integrantes {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>BURGCALC</h1>
    <nav aria-label="Navegação BURGCALC">
      <a href="/BURGCALC/calculo">Cálculo</a>
      <a href="/BURGCALC/sobre">Sobre</a>
      <a href="/BURGCALC/help">Help</a>
      <a href="/BURGCALC/login?ready=1">Login</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="painel">
      <h2>Sobre o projeto</h2>
      <p>BURGCALC calcula o custo de produção de hambúrgueres a partir dos custos dos ingredientes, embalagem, quantidade produzida e margem de lucro desejada.</p>

      <h2>Integrantes</h2>
      <div class="integrantes">
        <article class="integrante">
          <div class="foto">Foto do integrante</div>
          <strong>André Domingues Teixeira</strong>
        </article>
        <article class="integrante">
          <div class="foto">Foto do integrante</div>
          <strong>Pedro Henrique Kachan</strong>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
